intro: >-
  Centrapay had grown into a platform with a lot to say: payments, loyalty,
  digital infrastructure, and a range of technical solutions for different
  audiences. That breadth made the story harder to tell. The job wasn't just
  explaining what Centrapay does, but shaping it into something people could
  quickly understand, navigate, and connect with.
