The existing site needed to do more than present information. It had to simplify complex subjects, speak clearly to different audience groups, and bring cohesion to the brand. The visual language also needed to grow up to match the sophistication of the platform.

The result gave Centrapay a clearer voice and a stronger visual identity. Instead of overwhelming people with complexity, the site turns the platform into a story that feels coherent, credible, and easy to follow.
